- A merged header row (`Sample`, `Infection`)
- Spaces in the column names
- Information stored only as a background color (the yellow row)
- Dates in different, ambiguous formats instead of `YYYY-MM-DD`
- An empty cell for a missing value (`S75`), instead of `NA`
- Units in cells (`10 dpi`) instead of in the header
- Inconsistent labels: `Cathemerium` vs. `cathemerium`,
  and `ctrl` vs. `control`
- Two values in one cell:
  put the RNA yield note in a separate column

